ающие\\n<color=orange>награды!</color>\ntap_to_continue,,Tap To Continue,Devam Etmek İçin Dokun,Touchez Pour Continuer,タップして続行,点击继续,點擊繼續,계속하려면 탭,Ketuk Untuk Lanjut,Tippe zum Fortfahren,Toca Para Continuar,Tocca Per Continuare,Toque Para Continuar,Нажмите для продолжения\nweekly_mission_stage,,Stage,Aşama,Étape,ステージ,关卡,關卡,스테이지,Tahap,Stufe,Etapa,Fase,Fase,Этап\nweekly_adventure,,Weekly Adventure,Haftalık Macera,Aventure Hebdomadaire,ウィークリーアドベンチャー,每周冒险,每週冒險,주간 어드벤처,Petualangan Mingguan,Wöchentliches Abenteuer,Aventura Semanal,Avventura Settimanale,Aventura Semanal,Еженедельное приключение\nprofile,,Profile,Profil,Profil,プロフィール,个人资料,個人資料,프로필,Profil,Profil,Perfil,Profilo,Perfil,Профиль\nsuper_hard_double_row,,SUPER\\nHARD,SÜPER\\nZOR,SUPER\\nDIFFICILE,スーパー\\nハード,超级\\n困难,超級\\n困難,슈퍼\\n하드,SUPER\\nSULIT,SUPER\\nSCHWER,SÚPER\\nDIFÍCIL,SUPER\\nDIFFICILE,SUPER\\nDIFÍCIL,СУПЕР\\nСЛОЖНО\nsave,,Save,Kaydet,Sauvegarder,保存,保存,儲存,저장,Сохранить,Speichern,Guardar,Salvare,Salvar,Сохранить\nprofile_user_name,,Player,Oyuncu,Joueur,プレイヤー,玩家,玩家,플레이어,Pemain,Spieler,Jugador,Giocatore,Jogador,Игрок\nweekly_collect_targets_info,,Collect more golden  medals to unlock this stage!,Bu bölümü açmak için daha fazla altın  madalya topla!,Collecte plus de médailles en or pour débloquer ce niveau!,もっとゴールドメダルを集めてこのステージをアンロックしよう！,收集更多金牌来解锁此关卡！,收集更多金牌來解鎖此關卡！,골드 메달을 더 모아 이 스테이지를 잠금 해제하세요!,Kumpulkan lebih banyak medali  emas untuk membuka tahap ini!,\"Sammle mehr goldene  Medaillen, um diese Stufe freizuschalten!\",¡Consigue más medallas  de oro para desbloquear esta fase!,Raccogli più medaglie  d'oro per sbloccare questo livello!,Colete mais medalhas  de ouro para desbloquear esta fase!,\"Собери больше золотых  медалей, чтобы открыть этот этап!\"\nlava_rush,\"Lava Rush kelimesi özel isim değil. Tamamı çevirilmeli. Ayrıca, Rush'ın karşılığı yarış olacak her dilde. Örnek olarak türkçedeki karşılığı Lav Yarışı olacak.\",Lava Rush,Lav Yarışı,Course de lave,溶岩レース,熔岩竞速赛,熔岩競速賽,용암 레이스,Balapan Lava,Lava-Rennen,Carrera de Lava,Gara di Lava,Corrida de Lava,Лавовая гонка\nlava_rush_finding_players,,Finding players on your level,Sizin seviyenizdeki oyuncular bulunuyor,Trouver des joueurs à votre niveau,同レベルのプレイヤーを探しています,正在寻找与您同级的玩家,正在尋找與您同級的玩家,플레이어 찾는 중,Menemukan pemain di level Anda,Spieler auf deinem Niveau finden,Buscando jugadores de tu nivel,Trovare giocatori al tuo livello,Encontrando jogadores do seu nível,Поиск игроков вашего уровня\nlava_rush_fail_panel,\"Lava Rush kelimesi özel isim değil. Tamamı çevirilmeli. Ayrıca, Rush'ın karşılığı yarış olacak her dilde. Örnek olarak türkçedeki karşılığı Lav Yarışı olacak.\",You failed the challenge.\\nNext Lava Rush will\\nstarts in:,Meydan okumayı başaramadın.\\nBir sonraki Lav Yarışı\\nbaşlamasına:,Vous avez échoué au défi.\\nLa prochaine Course de lave\\ncommence dans:,チャレンジに失敗しました。\\n次の溶岩レースは\\n開始まで:,挑战失败。\\n下一场熔岩竞速赛\\n开始倒计时:,挑戰失敗。\\n下一場熔岩競速賽\\n開始倒數:,도전에 실패했습니다.\\n다음 용암 레이스는\\n시작까지:,Kamu gagal dalam tantangan.\\nBalapan Lava berikutnya\\nmulai dalam:,Du hast die Herausforderung nicht geschafft.\\nDas nächste Lava-Rennen\\nstartet in:,Has fallado el desafío.\\nLa próxima Carrera de Lava\\ncomienza en:,Hai fallito la sfida.\\nLa prossima Gara di Lava\\ninizia tra:,Você falhou no desafio.\\nA próxima Corrida de Lava\\ncomeça em:,Вы провалили испытание.\\nСледующая Лавовая гонка\\nначнется через:\nnoads_description_wanttobefree,,WANT TO BE <color=yellow>ADS FREE</color>?,REKLAMSIZ <color=yellow>OYNAMAK İSTER MİSİNİZ</color>?,VOUS VOULEZ ÊTRE <color=yellow>SANS PUBS</color> ?,<color=yellow>広告なし</color>にしたいですか？,想<color=yellow>无广告</color>吗？,想<color=yellow>無廣告</color>嗎？,<color=yellow>광고 없이</color> 무료로 사용하시겠습니까?,INGIN <color=yellow>BEBAS IKLAN</color>?,WERDEN SIE <color=yellow>WERBEFREI</color>?,¿QUIERES <color=yellow>SIN ANUNCIOS</color>?,VUOI <color=yellow>ESSERE SENZA PUBBLICITÀ</color>?,QUER <color=yellow>SEM ANÚNCIOS</color>?,ХОТИТЕ <color=yellow>БЕЗ РЕКЛАМЫ</color>?\nnoads_description_remove_now,,Remove Them Now!,Hemen Kaldırın!,Supprimez-les maintenant !,今すぐ削除！,立即移除！,立即移除！,지금 제거하세요!,Hapus Sekarang!,Jetzt entfernen!,¡Elimínalos ahora!,Rimuovili ora!,Remova Agora!,Сразу Удалить!\nnoads_description_remove_between_levels,,Remove ads between levels,Seviyeler arasında reklamları kaldırın,Supprimer les pubs entre les niveaux,レベル間の広告を削除する,移除关卡之间的广告,移除關卡之間的廣告,레벨 사이의 광고 제거,Buang iklankan antara level,Werbung zwischen den Levels entfernen,Eliminar anuncios entre niveles,Rimuovere gli annunci tra i livelli,Remova anúncios entre níveis,Удаление рекламы между уровнями\nnoads_description_optionals_remain,,Optional ads with bonuses remain available,Bonus reklamlar isteğe bağlı olarak kalır,Les annonces optionnelles avec bonus restent disponibles,ボーナス付きのオプション広告は利用可能なまま,附加奖励广告仍然可用,附加獎勵廣告仍然可用,보너스가 있는 선택적 광고는 그대로 남아 있습니다,Iklan opsional dengan bonus tetap tersedia,Optional-Werbung mit Boni bleibt verfügbar,Anuncios opcionales con bonificaciones permanecen disponibles,Gli annunci opzionali con bonus rimangono disponibili,Os anúncios opcionais com bônus continuam disponíveis,Опциональная реклама с бонусами остается доступной\nnoads_description_price,,One time purchase of {0} only!,Yalnızca {0} tutarında tek seferlik alım!,Achat unique de seulement {0} !,{0}のワンタイム購入のみ！,仅限一次性购买{0}！,僅限一次性購買{0}！,{0}의 일회성 구매만!,Pembelian satu kali hanya {0}!,Einmalkauf von nur {0}!,¡Compra única de solo {0}!,Acquisto una tantum di soli {0}!,Compra única de apenas {0}!,Однократная покупка всего за {0}!\nbutton_remove_ads,,Remove ADS!,Reklamları Kaldır!,Supprimer les pubs !,広告を消す！,移除广告！,移除廣告！,광고 제거!,Hapus Iklan!,Werbung entfernen!,¡Quitar anuncios!,Rimuovi annunci!,Remover anúncios!,Удалить рекламу!\nbutton_no_thanks_for_ads,,I'm ok with ads for now,Şimdilik reklamlar sorun değil,Je suis d'accord avec les pubs pour le moment,今のところ広告で大丈夫です,目前没广告也可以,目前沒廣告也可以,광고 괜찮습니다,Ikhlaskan Iklan Untuk Sekarang,Ich bin momentan mit Anzeigen einverstanden,De acuerdo con los anuncios por ahora,Per ora mi va bene la pubblicità,Por enquanto estou bem com anúncios,Пока реклама устраивает\nlava_rush_complate_info,,Beat {0} levels to complete the challenge!,Mücadeleyi tamamlamak için {0} bölümü geç!,Terminez {0} niveaux pour réussir le défi!,{0}レベルをクリアしてチャレンジを完了しよう！,通关{0}关以完成挑战！,通關{0}關以完成挑戰！,{0}레벨을 클리어해 도전을 완료하세요!,Selesaikan {0} level untuk menuntaskan tantangan!,\"Schließe {0} Level ab, um die Herausforderung zu meistern!\",Supera {0} niveles para completar el desafío!,Supera {0} livelli per completare la sfida!,Conclua {0} níveis para completar o desafio!,\"Пройди {0} уровней, чтобы завершить испытание!\"\nlevels,,Levels,Seviyeler,Niveaux,レベル,关卡,關卡,레벨,Level,Level,Niveles,Livelli,Níveis,Уровни\nplayers,,Players,Oyuncular,Joueurs,プレイヤー,玩家,玩家,플레이어,Pemain,Spieler,Jugadores,Giocatori,Jogadores,Игроки\nlava_rush_tutorial_info,,Start with <color=orange>100</color>\\nplayers!,<color=orange>100</color>\\noyuncu ile başla!,Commence avec <color=orange>100</color>\\njoueurs!,<color=orange>100</color>\\nプレイヤーでスタート!,以<color=orange>100</color>\\n名玩家开始!,以<color=orange>100</color>\\n名玩家開始!,<color=orange>100</color>\\n명의 플레이어로 시작!,Mulai dengan <color=orange>100</color>\\npemain!,Starte mit <color=orange>100</color>\\nSpielern!,Empieza con <color=orange>100</color>\\njugadores!,Inizia con <color=orange>100</color>\\ngiocatori!,Comece com <color=orange>100</color>\\njogadores!,Начни с <color=orange>100</color>\\nигроков!\nlava_rush_beat_levels,,Beat levels!,Seviyeleri geç!,Termine des niveaux!,レベルをクリアしよう!,通关关卡!,通關關卡!,레벨을 클리어하세요!,Kalahkan level!,Schließe Level ab!,Supera niveles!,Supera livelli!,Conclua níveis!,Проходи уровни!\nlava_rush_start_info,,Complete <color=red>{0} levels</color> to finish the mission,Görevi bitirmek için <color=red>{0} bölümü</color> tamamla,Terminez <color=red>{0} niveaux</color> pour finir la mission,ミッションを完了するには<color=red>{0}レベル</color>をクリアしよう,完成<color=red>{0}关</color>以结束任务,完成<color=red>{0}關</color>以結束任務,미션을 끝내려면 <color=red>{0}레벨</color>을 완료하세요,Selesaikan <color=red>{0} level</color> untuk menyelesaikan misi,\"Schließe <color=red>{0} Level</color> ab, um die Mission zu beenden\",Completa <color=red>{0} niveles</color> para terminar la misión,Completa <color=red>{0} livelli</color> per terminare la missione,Conclua <color=red>{0} níveis</color> para terminar a missão,\"Пройди <color=red>{0} уровней</color>, чтобы завершить миссию\"\nstart,,Start,Başla,Démarrer,開始,开始,開始,시작,Mulai,Start,Iniciar,Avvia,Iniciar,Старт\nbounce_pass_title,\"Bounce Pass kelimesinde, Bounce özel isim olarak kalacak. Pass kısmı ise çevrilecek\",Bounce Pass,Bounce Bileti,Passe Bounce,Bounceパス,Bounce通行证,Bounce通行證,Bounce 패스,Tiket Bounce,Bounce-Pass,Pase Bounce,Pass Bounce,Passe Bounce,Bounce-пропуск\nfree_coin,,Free Coin,Ücretsiz Jeton,Pièce gratuite,無料コイン,免费金币,免費金幣,무료 코인,Koin Gratis,Gratis-Münze,Moneda gratis,Moneta Gratis,Moeda Grátis,Бесплатная монета\nclaim,,Claim,Al,Récupérer,受け取る,领取,領取,받기,Klaim,Abholen,Reclamar,Riscatta,Resgatar,Забрать\ndo_you_need_space,,Need Space?,Yer mi lazım?,Besoin d'espace?,スペースが必要?,需要空间吗?,需要空間嗎?,공간이 필요해?,Butuh Ruang?,Platz nötig?,¿Necesitas espacio?,Hai bisogno di spazio?,Precisa de Espaço?,Нужно место?\nyou_win,,You win,Kazandın,Tu as gagné,あなたの勝ち,你赢了,你贏了,승리,Kamu menang,Du gewinnst,Has ganado,Hai vinto,Você venceu,Ты победил(а)\nlava_rush_win_panel_other_winners,,You are sharing the reward with {0} other winners!,{0} diğer kazananla ödülü paylaşıyorsun!,Tu partages la récompense avec {0} autres gagnants!,{0}人の他の勝者と報酬を分け合います!,你将与{0}名其他获胜者分享奖励！,你將與{0}名其他獲勝者分享獎勵！,다른 우승자 {0}명과 보상을 나눠 가집니다!,Kamu berbagi hadiah dengan {0} pemenang lainnya!,Du teilst die Belohnung mit {0} anderen Gewinnern!,¡Compartes la recompensa con otros {0} ganadores!,Stai condividendo la ricompensa con altri {0} vincitori!,Você está compartilhando a recompensa com outros {0} vencedores!,Ты делишь награду с {0} другими победителями!\nquit,,Quit,Çık,Quitter,終了,退出,退出,나가기,Keluar,Beenden,Salir,Esci,Sair,Выйти\nadd_space?,,Add Space?,Yer mi lazım?,Ajouter un espace?,スペースを追加?,添加空格？,新增空格？,공백 추가?,Tambahkan Spasi?,Leerzeichen hinzufügen?,¿Agregar espacio?,Aggiungere spazio?,Adicionar espaço?,Добавить пробел?\ngrand_prize,,Grand\\nPrize\\n<size=130%><b>{0}</b></size>,Büyük\\nÖdül\\n<size=130%><b>{0}</b></size>,Grand\\nPrix\\n<size=130%><b>{0}</b></size>,グランド\\nプライズ\\n<size=130%><b>{0}</b></size>,终极\\n大奖\\n<size=130%><b>{0}</b></size>,終極\\n大獎\\n<size=130%><b>{0}</b></size>,그랜드\\n프라이즈\\n<size=130%><b>{0}</b></size>,Hadiah\\nUtama\\n<size=130%><b>{0}</b></size>,Haupt-\\npreis\\n<size=130%><b>{0}</b></size>,Gran\\nPremio\\n<size=130%><b>{0}</b></size>,Gran\\nPremio\\n<size=130%><b>{0}</b></size>,Grande\\nPrêmio\\n<size=130%><b>{0}</b></size>,Главный\\nПриз\\n<size=130%><b>{0}</b></size>\nlava_rush_info_win,,Win your share of <color=orange>{0}</color> coins!,<color=orange>{0}</color> altınlık payını kazan!,Gagne ta part de <color=orange>{0}</color> pièces!,<color=orange>{0}</color>コインの取り分を獲得しよう!,赢得你应得的<color=orange>{0}</color>金币份额!,贏得你應得的<color=orange>{0}</color>金幣份額!,<color=orange>{0}</color>코인의 몫을 획득하세요!,Menangkan bagianmu dari <color=orange>{0}</color> koin!,Gewinne deinen Anteil an <color=orange>{0}</color> Münzen!,¡Gana tu parte de <color=orange>{0}</color> monedas!,Vinci la tua parte di <color=orange>{0}</color> monete!,Ganhe a sua parte de <color=orange>{0}</color> moedas!,Выиграй свою долю <color=orange>{0}</color> монет!\nlava_rush_info_game_info,,You will fail the challenge if you fail a level! Beat {0} level to complate the challange!,Bir seviyeyi geçemezsen görevi başaramazsın! Görevi tamamlamak için {0} seviye geç!,Vous échouerez au défi si vous échouez à un niveau! Terminez {0} niveau pour accomplir le défi!,レベルに失敗するとチャレンジ失敗！チャレンジをクリアするには{0}レベルをクリアしよう！,如果你关卡失败，挑战就会失败！通关{0}关即可完成挑战！,如果你關卡失敗，挑戰就會失敗！通關{0}關即可完成挑戰！,레벨에 실패하면 챌린지에 실패합니다! 챌린지를 완료하려면 {0}레벨을 클리어하세요!,Kamu akan gagal tantangan jika kamu gagal di level! Selesaikan {0} level untuk menyelesaikan tantangan!,\"Du scheiterst an der Herausforderung, wenn du ein Level verlierst! Schließe {0} Level ab, um die Herausforderung abzuschließen!\",Perderás el desafío si fallas un nivel! Supera {0} nivel para completar el desafío!,Fallirai la sfida se fallisci un livello! Supera {0} livello per completare la sfida!,Você falhará no desafio se falhar um nível! Complete {0} nível para concluir o desafio!,\"Ты провалишь испытание, если провалишь уровень! Пройди {0} уровень, чтобы завершить испытание!\"\nlava_rush_healt_system_info,\"Lava Rush kelimesi özel isim değil. Tamamı çevirilmeli. Ayrıca, Rush'ın karşılığı yarış olacak her dilde. Örnek olarak türkçedeki karşılığı Lav Yarışı olacak.\",Losing this level will get you kicked out of Lava Rush,Bu seviyeyi kaybedersen Lav Yarışı'ndan atılırsın,Ce niveau perdu vous fera exclure de la Course de lave,このレベルに負けると溶岩レースから追い出されます,失去这一关会让你被踢出熔岩竞速赛,失去這一關會讓你被踢出熔岩競速賽,이 레벨에서 지면 용암 레이스에서 퇴장당합니다,Kalah di level ini akan membuatmu dikeluarkan dari Balapan Lava,\"Wenn du dieses Level verlierst, wirst du aus dem Lava-Rennen geworfen\",Perder este nivel hará que te expulsen de la Carrera de Lava,Perdere questo livello ti farà espellere dalla Gara di Lava,Perder este nível fará você ser expulso da Corrida de Lava,Проигрыш на этом уровне выбросит вас из Лавовой гонки\nActivate,,Activate,Etkinleştir,Activer,有効化,激活,啟用,활성화,Aktifkan,Aktivieren,Activar,Attiva,Ativar,Активировать\nbeat_levels!,,Beat <color=orange>Levels</color>!,<color=orange>Seviyeleri</color> Geç!,Réussis les <color=orange>Niveaux</color>!,<color=orange>レベル</color>をクリアしよう!,通关<color=orange>关卡</color>!,通關<color=orange>關卡</color>!,<color=orange>레벨</color>을 클리어하세요!,Selesaikan <color=orange>Level</color>!,Schließe <color=orange>Level</color> ab!,Supera los <color=orange>Niveles</color>!,Supera i <color=orange>Livelli</color>!,Conclua os <color=orange>Níveis</color>!,Пройди <color=orange>уровни</color>!\ncollect_keys!,,Collect <color=orange>Keys</color>!,<color=orange>Anahtarları</color> Topla!,Collecte les <color=orange>Clés</color>!,<color=orange>カギ</color>を集めよう!,收集<color=orange>钥匙</color>!,收集<color=orange>鑰匙</color>!,<color=orange>열쇠</color>를 모으세요!,Kumpulkan <color=orange>Kunci</color>!,Sammle <color=orange>Schlüssel</color>!,Recolecta <color=orange>Llaves</color>!,Raccogli le <color=orange>Chiavi</color>!,Colete <color=orange>Chaves</color>!,Собери <color=orange>ключи</color>!\nunlock_rewards!,,Unlock <color=orange>Rewards</color>!,<color=orange>Ödüllerin</color> Kilidini Aç!,Débloque les <color=orange>Récompenses</color>!,<color=orange>報酬</color>をアンロックしよう!,解锁<color=orange>奖励</color>!,解鎖<color=orange>獎勵</color>!,<color=orange>보상</color>을 잠금 해제하세요!,Buka <color=orange>Hadiah</color>!,Schalte <color=orange>Belohnungen</color> frei!,Desbloquea <color=orange>Recompensas</color>!,Sblocca le <color=orange>Ricompense</color>!,Desbloqueie <color=orange>Recompensas</color>!,Открой <color=orange>награды</color>!\nyou_can_activate_bouncepass_description,\"Bounce Pass kelimesinde, Bounce özel isim olarak kalacak. Pass kısmı ise çevrilecek\",You can activate the <color=orange>Bounce Pass</color> to get additional exclusive rewards!,Ek özel ödüller almak için <color=orange>Bounce Bileti</color>'ni etkinleştirebilirsin!,Ek özel ödüller almak için <color=orange>Bounce Bileti</color>'ni etkinleştirebilirsin!,Tu peux activer le <color=orange>Passe Bounce</color> pour obtenir des récompenses exclusives supplémentaires!,<color=orange>Bounceパス</color>を有効化すると、追加の限定報酬を獲得できます!,你可以激活<color=orange>Bounce通行证</color>以获得额外的专属奖励!,你可以啟用<color=orange>Bounce通行證</color>以獲得額外的專屬獎勵!,<color=orange>Bounce 패스</color>를 활성화하여 추가 독점 보상을 받을 수 있어요!,Kamu dapat mengaktifkan <color=orange>Tiket Bounce</color> untuk mendapatkan hadiah eksklusif tambahan!,\"Du kannst den <color=orange>Bounce-Pass</color> aktivieren, um zusätzliche exklusive Belohnungen zu erhalten!\",Puedes activar el <color=orange>Pase Bounce</color> para obtener recompensas exclusivas adicionales!,Puoi attivare il <color=orange>Pass Bounce</color> per ottenere ricompense esclusive aggiuntive!,Você pode ativar o <color=orange>Passe Bounce</color> para obter recompensas exclusivas adicionais!\nlava_rush_chalange_player_info,,There are 100 players in the challenge!,Meydan okumada 100 oyuncu var!,Il y a 100 joueurs dans le défi!,チャレンジには100人のプレイヤーがいます！,挑战中有100名玩家！,挑戰中有100名玩家！,챌린지에 플레이어 100명이 있습니다!,Ada 100 pemain dalam tantangan!,Es gibt 100 Spieler in der Herausforderung!,Hay 100 jugadores en el desafío!,Ci sono 100 giocatori nella sfida!,Há 100 jogadores no desafio!,В испытании участвуют 100 игроков!\nlava_rush_first_try_info,,Beat levels on your first try to advance to the next step!,İlk denemende bölümleri geçerek bir sonraki adıma ilerle!,Réussis les niveaux du premier coup pour passer à l'étape suivante!,一発クリアで次のステップに進もう!,首次尝试通关即可进入下一步!,首次嘗試通關即可進入下一步!,첫 시도에 레벨을 클리어해 다음 단계로 진행하세요!,Selesaikan level pada percobaan pertama untuk maju ke tahap berikutnya!,\"Schließe Level beim ersten Versuch ab, um zum nächsten Schritt zu gelangen!\",Supera los niveles en tu primer intento para avanzar al siguiente paso!,Supera i livelli al primo tentativo per avanzare al passo successivo!,Vença as fases na primeira tentativa para avançar para a próxima etapa!,\"Пройди уровни с первой попытки, чтобы перейти к следующему этапу!\"\nbounce_pass_vault_description_if_iap_not_bought,\"Bounce Pass kelimesinde, Bounce özel isim olarak kalacak. Pass kısmı ise çevrilecek\",Activate the <color=orange>Bounce Pass</color> to unlock <color=green>Bounce Bank</color> for great rewards at the end of the stages!,<color=orange>Bounce Bileti</color>'ni etkinleştirerek <color=green>Bounce Bank</color>'i aç ve bölümlerin sonunda harika ödüller kazan!,Active le <color=orange>Passe Bounce</color> pour déverrouiller la <color=green>Bounce Bank</color> et obtenir de super récompenses à la fin des niveaux!,<color=orange>Bounceパス</color>を有効化して<color=green>Bounce Bank</color>をアンロックし、ステージの最後に豪華報酬を獲得しよう!,激活<color=orange>Bounce通行证</color>即可解锁<color=green>Bounce Bank</color>，在关卡结束时获得丰厚奖励!,啟用<color=orange>Bounce通行證</color>即可解鎖<color=green>Bounce Bank</color>，在關卡結束時獲得豐厚獎勵!,<color=orange>Bounce 패스</color>를 활성화해 <color=green>Bounce Bank</color>를 잠금 해제하고 스테이지 끝에서 멋진 보상을 받으세요!,Aktifkan <color=orange>Tiket Bounce</color> untuk membuka <color=green>Bounce Bank</color> dan dapatkan hadiah keren di akhir level!,\"Aktiviere den <color=orange>Bounce-Pass</color>, um die <color=green>Bounce Bank</color> freizuschalten und am Ende der Stufen tolle Belohnungen zu erhalten!\",Activa el <color=orange>Pase Bounce</color> para desbloquear el <color=green>Bounce Bank</color> y conseguir grandes recompensas al final de las fases!,Attiva il <color=orange>Pass Bounce</color> per sbloccare la <color=green>Bounce Bank</color> e ottenere fantastiche ricompense alla fine dei livelli!,Ative o <color=orange>Passe Bounce</color> para desbloquear o <color=green>Bounce Bank</color> e ganhar ótimas recompensas no fim das fases!,\"Активируй <color=orange>Bounce-пропуск</color>, чтобы открыть <color=green>Bounce Bank</color> и получить отличные награды в конце этапов!\"\nbounce_pass_vault_description_if_iap_bought,,Reach end of stages to collect <color=green>Bounce Bank</color> that contains great rewards!,Bölümlerin sonuna ulaşarak harika ödüller içeren <color=green>Bounce Bank</color>'i topla!,Atteins la fin des niveaux pour récupérer la <color=green>Bounce Bank</color> qui contient de super récompenses!,ステージの最後まで到達して、豪華報酬が入った<color=green>バウンスバンク</color>を獲得しよう！,到达关卡终点即可领取包含丰厚奖励的<color=green>弹跳银行</color>！,到達關卡終點即可領取包含豐厚獎勵的<color=green>彈跳銀行</color>！,스테이지 끝에 도달해 푸짐한 보상이 들어 있는 <color=green>바운스 뱅크</color>를 획득하세요!,Capai akhir level untuk mengumpulkan <color=green>Bounce Bank</color> berisi hadiah hebat!,\"Erreiche das Ende der Stufen, um die <color=green>Bounce-Bank</color> mit tollen Belohnungen einzusammeln!\",Llega al final de los niveles para recoger el <color=green>Banco Bounce</color> con grandes recompensas!,Raggiungi la fine dei livelli per raccogliere la <color=green>Banca Bounce</color> che contiene grandi ricompense!,Chegue ao fim das fases para coletar o <color=green>Banco Bounce</color> com grandes recompensas!,\"Дойдите до конца уровней, чтобы собрать <color=green>Банк Bounce</color> с отличными наградами!\"\nplay_level,,Play {0} Level,{0} Seviye Oyna,Jouez {0} niveaux,{0}レベルをプレイする,游玩{0}关,遊玩{0}關,{0}레벨 플레이,Mainkan {0} Level,Spiele {0} Level,Juega {0} niveles,Gioca {0} livelli,Jogue {0} níveis,Сыграйте {0} уровней\nwin_level_in_row,,Win {0} Level in a row,{0} Seviyeyi Üst Üste Kazan,Gagnez {0} niveaux d'affilée,{0}レベル連続で勝利する,连续赢得{0}关,連續贏得{0}關,{0}레벨 연속 승리,Menangkan {0} Level berturut-turut,Gewinne {0} Level in Folge,Gana {0} niveles seguidos,Vinci {0} livelli di fila,Vença {0} níveis seguidos,Выиграйте {0} уровней подряд\nwin_hard_level,,Win {0} Hard Levels,{0} Zor Seviye Kazan,Gagnez {0} niveaux difficiles,ハードレベルを{0}回クリアする,赢得{0}个困难关卡,贏得{0}個困難關卡,하드 레벨 {0}개 승리,Menangkan {0} Level Sulit,Gewinne {0} schwere Level,Gana {0} niveles difíciles,Vinci {0} livelli difficili,Vença {0} níveis difíceis,Выиграйте {0} сложных уровней\nspend_coin,,Spend {0} Coin,{0} Coin Harca,Dépensez {0} pièces,コインを{0}枚使う,花费{0}金币,花費{0}金幣,코인 {0}개 사용,Habiskan {0} Koin,Gib {0} Münzen aus,Gasta {0} monedas,Spendi {0} monete,Gaste {0} moedas,Потратьте {0} монет\nwatch_rewards,,Watch {0} Reward,{0} Ödül İzle,Regardez {0} récompenses,報酬を{0}回視聴する,观看{0}次奖励,觀看{0}次獎勵,보상 {0}회 시청,Tonton {0} Hadiah,Sieh dir {0} Belohnungen an,Mira {0} recompensas,Guarda {0} ricompense,Assista a {0} recompensas,Посмотрите {0} наград\nuse_magic_hand,,Use {0} Magic Hand,{0} Sihirli El Kullan,Utilisez {0} mains magiques,マジックハンドを{0}回使う,使用{0}个魔法之手,使用{0}個魔法之手,매직 핸드 {0}개 사용,Gunakan {0} Tangan Ajaib,Nutze {0} magische Hände,Usa {0} manos mágicas,Usa {0} Mani magiche,Use {0} Mãos mágicas,Используйте {0} Волшебных рук\nuse_booster,,Use {0} Booster,{0} Booster Kullan,Utilisez {0} boosters,ブースターを{0}回使う,使用{0}个助推器,使用{0}個助推器,부스터 {0}개 사용,Gunakan {0} Booster,Nutze {0} Booster,Usa {0} potenciadores,Usa {0} booster,Use {0} boosters,Используйте {0} бустеров\nspecial_rewards,,Special Rewards,Özel Ödüller,Récompenses spéciales,特別報酬,特殊奖励,特殊獎勵,특별 보상,Hadiah Spesial,Spezielle Belohnungen,Recompensas especiales,Ricompense speciali,Recompensas especiais,Особые награды\nbounce_pass_buy_pop_up_description,\"Bounce Pass kelimesinde, Bounce özel isim olarak kalacak. Pass kısmı ise çevrilecek\",The <color=green>Bounce Pass</color> will give you a chance to get special rewards!,<color=green>Bounce Bileti</color> sana özel ödüller kazanma şansı verecek!,Le <color=green>Passe Bounce</color> te donnera une chance d'obtenir des récompenses spéciales!,<color=green>Bounceパス</color>で特別な報酬を手に入れるチャンスが得られます!,<color=green>Bounce通行证</color>将给你获得特殊奖励的机会!,<color=green>Bounce通行證</color>將給你獲得特殊獎勵的機會!,<color=green>Bounce 패스</color>로 특별 보상을 얻을 기회를 드려요!,<color=green>Tiket Bounce</color> memberi kamu kesempatan untuk mendapatkan hadiah spesial!,\"Der <color=green>Bounce-Pass</color> gibt dir die Chance, besondere Belohnungen zu erhalten!\",El <color=green>Pase Bounce</color> te dará la oportunidad de conseguir recompensas especiales!,Il <color=green>Pass Bounce</color> ti darà la possibilità di ottenere ricompense speciali!,O <color=green>Passe Bounce</color> vai te dar a chance de obter recompensas especiais!,<color=green>Bounce-пропуск</color> даст тебе шанс получить особые награды!\nyou_will_have_exclusive_rewards,,You will have exclusive bonuses until the event ends,Etkinlik bitene kadar özel bonuslara sahip olacaksın,Vous aurez des bonus exclusifs jusqu'à la fin de l'événement,イベント終了まで限定ボーナスがもらえます,活动结束前你将拥有专属加成,活動結束前你將擁有專屬加成,이벤트가 끝날 때까지 전용 보너스를 받을 수 있습니다,Kamu akan mendapatkan bonus eksklusif hingga event berakhir,Du erhältst exklusive Boni bis zum Ende des Events,Tendrás bonificaciones exclusivas hasta que termine el evento,Avrai bonus esclusivi fino alla fine dell'evento,Você terá bônus exclusivos até o evento terminar,У вас будут эксклюзивные бонусы до конца события\n8_lives_instead_of_5,,8 lives instead of 5,5 yerine 8 can,8 vies au lieu de 5,5つではなく8ライフ,8条命而不是5条,8條命而不是5條,5개 대신 8개의 라이프,8 nyawa alih-alih 5,8 Leben statt 5,8 vidas en lugar de 5,8 vite invece di 5,8 vidas em vez de 5,8 жизней вместо 5\ngolden_pp_reward,,Golden profile picture and golden name,Altın profil resmi ve altın isim,Photo de profil dorée et nom doré,ゴールドのプロフィール画像とゴールドの名前,金色头像和金色昵称,金色頭像和金色暱稱,골드 프로필 사진과 골드 닉네임,Foto profil emas dan nama emas,Goldenes Profilbild und goldener Name,Foto de perfil dorada y nombre dorado,Immagine profilo dorata e nome dorato,Foto de perfil dourada e nome dourado,Золотая аватарка и золотое имя\nbounce_bank_rewards,,Bounce Bank with amazing rewards at the end of pass,Pass sonunda muhteşem ödüller veren Bounce Bank,Bounce Bank avec d'incroyables récompenses à la fin du pass,パスの最後に豪華報酬がもらえるBounce Bank,通行证结束时可获得丰厚奖励的Bounce Bank,通行證結束時可獲得豐厚獎勵的Bounce Bank,패스 끝에 엄청난 보상이 있는 Bounce Bank,Bounce Bank dengan hadiah luar biasa di akhir pass,Bounce Bank mit tollen Belohnungen am Ende des Passes,Bounce Bank con recompensas increíbles al final del pase,Bounce Bank con fantastiche ricompense alla fine del pass,Bounce Bank com recompensas incríveis no final do passe,Bounce Bank с потрясающими наградами в конце пропуска\ndaily_challenge_title,,Daily Challenge,Günlük Meydan Okuma,Défi quotidien,デイリーチャレンジ,每日挑战,每日挑戰,일일 챌린지,Tantangan Harian,Tägliche Herausforderung,Desafío diario,Sfida giornaliera,Desafio diário,Ежедневное испытание\nmonth_January,,January,Ocak,Janvier,1,1,1,1,Januari,Januar,Enero,Gennaio,Janeiro,Январь\nmonth_February,,February,Şubat,Février,2,2,2,2,Februari,Februar,Febrero,Febbraio,Fevereiro,Февраль\nmonth_March,,March,Mart,Mars,3,3,3,3,Maret,März,Marzo,Marzo,Março,Март\nmonth_April,,April,Nisan,Avril,4,4,4,4,April,April,Abril,Aprile,Abril,Апрель\nmonth_May,,May,Mayıs,Mai,5,5,5,5,Mei,Mai,Mayo,Maggio,Maio,Май\nmonth_June,,June,Haziran,Juin,6,6,6,6,Juni,Juni,Junio,Giugno,Junho,Июнь\nmonth_July,,July,Temmuz,Juillet,7,7,7,7,Juli,Juli,Julio,Luglio,Julho,Июль\nmonth_August,,August,Ağustos,Août,8,8,8,8,Agustus,August,Agosto,Agosto,Agosto,Август\nmonth_September,,September,Eylül,Septembre,9,9,9,9,September,September,Septiembre,Settembre,Setembro,Сентябрь\nmonth_October,,October,Ekim,Octobre,10,10,10,10,Oktober,Oktober,Octubre,Ottobre,Outubro,Октябрь\nmonth_November,,November,Kasım,Novembre,11,11,11,11,November,November,Noviembre,Novembre,Novembro,Ноябрь\nmonth_December,,December,Aralık,Décembre,12,12,12,12,Desember,Dezember,Diciembre,Dicembre,Dezembro,Декабрь\nbounce_streak_title,,Beat Levels without fail to get more rewards!,Daha fazla ödül almak için seviyeleri hatasız geç!,Terminez les niveaux sans échouer pour obtenir plus de récompenses!,失敗せずにレベルをクリアして、より多くの報酬を獲得しよう！,无失误通关关卡以获得更多奖励！,不失誤通關關卡以獲得更多獎勵！,실패 없이 레벨을 클리어하면 더 많은 보상을 받을 수 있어요!,Selesaikan level tanpa gagal untuk mendapatkan lebih banyak hadiah!,\"Schließe Level ohne Fehlschlag ab, um mehr Belohnungen zu erhalten!\",Supera niveles sin fallar para obtener más recompensas!,Supera i livelli senza fallire per ottenere più ricompense!,Passe de fase sem falhar para ganhar mais recompensas!,\"Проходите уровни без ошибок, чтобы получить больше наград!\"\nbounce_streak,,Golden Challenge,Altın Mücadelesi,Défi Doré,ゴールデンチャレンジ,黄金挑战,黃金挑戰,골든 챌린지,Tantangan Emas,Goldene Herausforderung,Desafío Dorado,Sfida Dorata,Desafio Dourado,Золотое испытание\nundobooster_no_undo_message,,No moves to undo!,Geri alınacak hamle yok!,Aucun coup à annuler!,元に戻せる手がありません！,没有可撤销的步数！,沒有可復原的步數！,되돌릴 수 있는 이동이 없어요!,Tidak ada langkah untuk dibatalkan!,Keine Züge zum Rückgängig machen!,¡No hay movimientos para deshacer!,Nessuna mossa da annullare!,Não há jogadas para desfazer!,Нет ходов для отмены!\ndate_format_day_month_zero_is_month_one_is_day,,{0} {1},{1} {0},{1} {0},{0}月{1}日,{0}月{1}日,{0}月{1}日,{0}월 {1}일,{1} {0},{1}. {0},{1} de {0},{1} {0},{1} de {0},{1} {0}\nplay,,Play,Oyna,Jouer,プレイ,开始,開始,플레이,Main,Spielen,Jugar,Gioca,Jogar,Играть\nbounce_streak_popup_title,,Golden Challenge started! Keep winning and earn rewards throughout your winnig streak,Altın Mücadelesi başladı! Galibiyet serin boyunca kazanmaya devam et ve ödüller kazan,Le Défi Doré a commencé ! Continue à gagner et remporte des récompenses tout au long de ta série de victoires,ゴールデンチャレンジ開始！連勝を続けて、連勝中ずっと報酬を獲得しよう,黄金挑战开始！保持连胜，在你的连胜期间持续赢取奖励,黃金挑戰開始！保持連勝，在你的連勝期間持續贏取獎勵,골든 챌린지 시작! 연승을 이어가며 연승 기간 내내 보상을 획득하세요,Tantangan Emas dimulai! Terus menang dan raih hadiah sepanjang rentetan kemenanganmu,Goldene Herausforderung gestartet! Gewinne weiter und verdiene Belohnungen während deiner Siegesserie,¡El Desafío Dorado empezó! Sigue ganando y consigue recompensas durante tu racha de victorias,Sfida Dorata iniziata! Continua a vincere e ottieni ricompense per tutta la tua serie di vittorie,Desafio Dourado iniciado! Continue vencendo e ganhe recompensas durante sua sequência de vitórias,Золотое испытание началось! Продолжай побеждать и получай награды на протяжении серии побед\nbouce_sterak_tutorail_info,,Complate the levels\\nwithout losing a life,Can kaybetmeden\\nseviyeleri tamamla,Termine les niveaux\\nsans perdre de vie,ライフを失わずに\\nレベルをクリアしよう,不损失生命地\\n通关关卡,不損失生命地\\n通關關卡,목숨을 잃지 않고\\n레벨을 완료하세요,Selesaikan level\\ntanpa kehilangan nyawa,Schließe die Level ab\\nohne ein Leben zu verlieren,Completa los niveles\\nsin perder una vida,Completa i livelli\\nsenza perdere una vita,Complete os níveis\\nsem perder uma vida,Пройди уровни\\nне потеряв ни одной жизни\nbounce_sterak_tutorail_info2,,Collect golden medals!,Altın madalyaları topla!,Collecte des médailles en or!,ゴールドメダルを集めよう！,收集金牌！,收集金牌！,골드 메달을 모으세요!,Kumpulkan medali emas!,Sammle goldene Medaillen!,¡Consigue medallas de oro!,Raccogli medaglie d'oro!,Colete medalhas de ouro!,Собирай золотые медали!\nbounce_sterak_tutorail_info3,,Win awesome prizes!,Harika ödüller kazan!,Gagne des récompenses géniales !,豪華な報酬を獲得しよう！,赢取超棒奖励！,贏取超棒獎勵！,멋진 보상을 획득하세요!,Menangkan hadiah keren!,Gewinne tolle Preise!,¡Gana premios increíbles!,Vinci fantastici premi!,Ganhe prêmios incríveis!,Выигрывай крутые призы!\nbounce_sterak_tutorail_info4,,Every failture resets your multiplier to zero,Her başarısızlık çarpanını sıfırlar,Chaque échec réinitialise ton multiplicateur à zéro,失敗するたびに倍率が0にリセットされます,每次失败都会将倍率重置为0,每次失敗都會將倍率重置為0,실패할 때마다 배수가 0으로 초기화됩니다,Setiap kegagalan mengatur ulang pengalimu menjadi nol,Jeder Fehlschlag setzt deinen Multiplikator auf null zurück,Cada fallo restablece tu multiplicador a cero,Ogni fallimento azzera il tuo moltiplicatore,Cada falha redefine seu multiplicador para zero,Каждая неудача сбрасывает множитель до нуля\nbounce_streak_heart_systembar,,Score Multiplier of the\\n<color=red>Bullseye</color> will be reset?,Skor Çarpanı\\n<color=red>Tam İsabet</color> için sıfırlanacak mı?,Le multiplicateur de score du\\n<color=red>Bullseye</color> sera réinitialisé?,<color=red>ブルズアイ</color>の\\nスコア倍率をリセットしますか？,是否重置\\n<color=red>靶心</color>的得分倍率?,是否重置\\n<color=red>靶心</color>的得分倍率?,<color=red>불스아이</color>의\\n점수 배율을 초기화할까요?,Pengali Skor untuk\\n<color=red>Bullseye</color> akan direset?,Punktemultiplikator für\\n<color=red>Bullseye</color> wird zurückgesetzt?,Se reiniciará el multiplicador de puntuación del\\n<color=red>Bullseye</color>?,Il moltiplicatore di punteggio del\\n<color=red>Bullseye</color> verrà azzerato?,O multiplicador de pontuação do\\n<color=red>Bullseye</color> será redefinido?,Сбросить множитель очков для\\n<color=red>Буллсай</color>?\ndays,,DAYS,GÜN,JOURS,日,天,天,일,HARI,TAGE,DÍAS,GIORNI,DIAS,ДНИ\ngrand_prize_text,,Grand Prize!,Büyük Ödül!,Grand lot!,大賞!,大奖!,大獎!,대상!,Hadiah Utama!,Hauptpreis!,Gran premio!,Gran premio!,Grande Prêmio!,Главный приз!\nyou_wil_lose_your_collection,,You will lose\\nyour medals,Madalyalarını\\nkaybedeceksin,Tu perdras\\ntes médailles,メダルを\\n失います,你将失去\\n你的金牌,你將失去\\n你的金牌,메달을\\n잃게 됩니다,Kamu akan kehilangan\\nmedalmu,Du wirst\\ndeine Medaillen verlieren,Perderás\\ntus medallas,Perderai\\nle tue medaglie,Você perderá\\nsuas medalhas,Ты потеряешь\\nсвои медали\n_collected,,COLLECTED,TOPLANDI,RÉCUPÉRÉ,獲得済み,已收集,已收集,수집 완료,TERKUMPUL,EINGESAMMELT,RECOGIDO,RACCOLTO,COLETADO,СОБРАНО\nan_unknown_error_occured,,\"AN UNKNOWN ERROR OCCURED!\"\"\",\"BİLİNMEYEN BİR HATA OLUŞTU!\"\"\",\"UNE ERREUR INCONNUE S'EST PRODUITE!\"\"\",\"不明なエラーが発生しました!\"\"\",\"发生未知错误!\"\"\",\"發生未知錯誤!\"\"\",\"알 수 없는 오류가 발생했습니다!\"\"\",\"TERJADI KESALAHAN TIDAK DIKETAHUI!\"\"\",\"EIN UNBEKANNTER FEHLER IST AUFGETRETEN!\"\"\",\"SE HA PRODUCIDO UN ERROR DESCONOCIDO!\"\"\",\"SI È VERIFICATO UN ERRORE SCONOSCIUTO!\"\"\",\"OCORREU UM ERRO DESCONHECIDO!\"\"\",\"ПРОИЗОШЛА НЕИЗВЕСТНАЯ ОШИБКА!\"\"\"\nnotif_lava_rush_ready,,🌋 Missed it? Lava Quest is BACK!,🌋 Kaçırdın mı? Lava Quest GERİ DÖNDÜ!,🌋 Tu l'as raté? Lava Quest est DE RETOUR!,🌋 見逃した？Lava Questが復活！,🌋 错过了？Lava Quest回归啦！,🌋 錯過了？Lava Quest回歸啦！,🌋 놓쳤나요? Lava Quest가 돌아왔다!,🌋 Ketinggalan? Lava Quest KEMBALI!,🌋 Verpasst? Lava Quest ist ZURÜCK!,🌋 ¿Te lo perdiste? ¡Lava Quest está DE VUELTA!,🌋 Te lo sei perso? Lava Quest è TORNATA!,🌋 Perdeu? Lava Quest ESTÁ DE VOLTA!,🌋 Пропустили? Lava Quest ВОЗВРАЩАЕТСЯ!\nnotif_lava_rush_mesage,,The 5000 coin prize pool is waiting! Don't let it slip away this time. Join 100 players and grab your share before the timer runs out! 🏃💨💰,5000 coin'lik ödül havuzu seni bekliyor! Bu sefer elinden kaçırma. 100 oyuncuya katıl ve süre dolmadan payını kap! 🏃💨💰,La cagnotte de 5000 pièces t'attend! Ne la laisse pas filer cette fois-ci. Rejoins 100 joueurs et récupère ta part avant la fin du chrono! 🏃💨💰,5000コインの賞金プールが待ってる！今度こそ逃さないで。100人のプレイヤーに参加して、タイマーが切れる前に取り分をゲットしよう！ 🏃💨💰,5000金币奖池在等你！这次别再错过了。加入100名玩家，在倒计时结束前拿走你的那份！ 🏃💨💰,5000金幣獎池在等你！這次別再錯過了。加入100名玩家，在倒數計時結束前拿走你的那份！ 🏃💨💰,\"5000코인 상금 풀이 기다리고 있어요! 이번엔 놓치지 마세요. 100명의 플레이어와 함께 참여하고, 타이머가 끝나기 전에 몫을 챙기세요! 🏃💨💰\",Kumpulan hadiah 5000 koin sudah menunggu! Jangan sampai terlewat kali ini. Bergabunglah dengan 100 pemain dan ambil bagianmu sebelum waktunya habis! 🏃💨💰,\"Der Preispool mit 5000 Münzen wartet! Lass ihn dir dieses Mal nicht entgehen. Schließe dich 100 Spielern an und schnapp dir deinen Anteil, bevor der Timer abläuft! 🏃💨💰\",¡El pozo de premios de 5000 monedas te espera! No dejes que se escape esta vez. Únete a 100 jugadores y consigue tu parte antes de que se acabe el tiempo! 🏃💨💰,Il montepremi da 5000 monete ti aspetta! Non lasciartelo sfuggire stavolta. Unisciti a 100 giocatori e prendi la tua parte prima che il timer scada! 🏃💨💰,O prêmio coletivo de 5000 moedas está esperando! Não deixe escapar desta vez. Junte-se a 100 jogadores e pegue sua parte antes do tempo acabar! 🏃💨💰,\"Призовой фонд в 5000 монет ждёт! Не упусти его на этот раз. Присоединяйся к 100 игрокам и забирай свою долю, пока не закончился таймер! 🏃💨💰\"\nbounce_pass_join_description,\"Bounce Pass kelimesinde, Bounce özel isim olarak kalacak. Pass kısmı ise çevrilecek\",Bounce Pass started. Play the game and win lots of <color=red>great prizes.</color>,Bounce Bileti başladı. Oyunu oyna ve bol bol <color=red>harika ödüller kazan.</color>,Le Passe Bounce a commencé. Joue au jeu et gagne plein de <color=red>super lots.</color>,Bounceパスが開始しました。ゲームをプレイして、たくさんの<color=red>豪華賞品を獲得しよう。</color>,Bounce通行证已开始。玩游戏，赢取大量<color=red>超棒奖品。</color>,Bounce通行證已開始。玩遊戲，贏取大量<color=red>超棒獎品。</color>,Bounce 패스가 시작됐어요. 게임을 플레이하고 많은 <color=red>멋진 상품을 획득하세요.</color>,Tiket Bounce dimulai. Mainkan game dan menangkan banyak <color=red>hadiah keren.</color>,Der Bounce-Pass hat begonnen. Spiele das Spiel und gewinne viele <color=red>tolle Preise.</color>,El Pase Bounce ha comenzado. Juega y gana muchos <color=red>grandes premios.</color>,Il Pass Bounce è iniziato. Gioca e vinci tanti <color=red>fantastici premi.</color>,O Passe Bounce começou. Jogue e ganhe muitos <color=red>grandes prêmios.</color>,Bounce-пропуск начался. Играй и выигрывай много <color=red>классных призов.</color>\ngrand_prize_text_row,,Grand\\nPrize!,Büyük\\nÖdül!,Grand\\nPrix!,最優秀\\n賞!,终极\\n大奖!,終極\\n大獎!,최고\\n상!,Hadiah\\nUtama!,Großer\\nPreis!,Gran\\nPremio!,Gran\\nPremio!,Grande\\nPrêmio!,Главный\\nПриз!\nopen,,Open,Aç,Ouvrir,開く,打开,打開,열기,Buka,Öffnen,Abrir,Aprire,Abrir,Открыть\ngolden_cup,,Golden Cup,Altın Kupa,Coupe d'or,ゴールデンカップ,黄金奖杯,黃金獎盃,골든 컵,Piala Emas,Goldener Pokal,Copa Dorada,Coppa Dorata,Taça Dourada,Золотой кубок\ncollect_more_keys_to,,Collect more <color=orange>keys</color> to unlock this stage and get this reward!,Bu aşamayı açmak ve bu ödülü almak için daha fazla <color=orange>anahtar</color> topla!,Collecte plus de <color=orange>clés</color> pour déverrouiller ce niveau et obtenir cette récompense!,さらに多くの<color=orange>鍵</color>を集めてこのステージをアンロックし、この報酬を獲得しよう!,收集更多<color=orange>钥匙</color>来解锁此关卡并获得此奖励!,收集更多<color=orange>鑰匙</color>來解鎖此關卡並獲得此獎勵!,더 많은 <color=orange>열쇠</color>를 모아 이 스테이지를 잠금 해제하고 이 보상을 받으세요!,Kumpulkan lebih banyak <color=orange>kunci</color> untuk membuka stage ini dan dapatkan hadiah ini!,\"Sammle mehr <color=orange>Schlüssel</color>, um diese Stufe freizuschalten und diese Belohnung zu erhalten!\",Reúne más <color=orange>llaves</color> para desbloquear esta fase y obtener esta recompensa!,Raccogli altre <color=orange>chiavi</color> per sbloccare questa fase e ottenere questa ricompensa!,Colete mais <color=orange>chaves</color> para desbloquear esta fase e receber esta recompensa!,\"Собери больше <color=orange>ключей</color>, чтобы открыть этот этап и получить эту награду!\"\nunlock_this_stage_of_bounce_pass,\"Bounce Pass kelimesinde, Bounce özel isim olarak kalacak. Pass kısmı ise çevrilecek\",Unlock this stage and activate the <color=orange>Bounce Pass</color> to get this reward!,Bu ödülü almak için bu aşamayı açın ve <color=orange>Bounce Bileti</color>ni etkinleştirin!,Débloquez ce niveau et activez le <color=orange>Bounce Passe</color> pour obtenir cette récompense!,このステージをアンロックして<color=orange>Bounce パス</color>を有効にし、この報酬を獲得しよう!,解锁此阶段并激活<color=orange>Bounce 通行证</color>以获得此奖励!,解鎖此階段並啟用<color=orange>Bounce 通行證</color>以獲得此獎勵!,이 단계를 잠금 해제하고 <color=orange>Bounce 패스</color>를 활성화하여 이 보상을 받으세요!,Buka tahap ini dan aktifkan <color=orange>Bounce Tiket</color> untuk mendapatkan hadiah ini!,\"Schalte diese Stufe frei und aktiviere den <color=orange>Bounce Pass</color>, um diese Belohnung zu erhalten!\",¡Desbloquea esta etapa y activa el <color=orange>Bounce Pase</color> para conseguir esta recompensa!,Sblocca questa fase e attiva il <color=orange>Bounce Pass</color> per ottenere questa ricompensa!,Desbloqueie esta etapa e ative o <color=orange>Bounce Passe</color> para obter esta recompensa!,\"Разблокируйте этот этап и активируйте <color=orange>Bounce Пропуск</color>, чтобы получить эту награду!\"\ngolden_cup_popup_text,,Win a level to earn unlimited lives and join <color=#B95418>Golden Cup!</color>,\"Bir seviye kazan, sınırsız can kazan ve <color=#B95418>Altın Kupa'ya!</color> katıl\",Gagnez un niveau pour obtenir des vies illimitées et rejoindre la <color=#B95418>Coupe d'Or!</color>,レベルをクリアして無限ライフを獲得し、<color=#B95418>ゴールデンカップ!</color>に参加しよう,赢得一关即可获得无限生命，并加入<color=#B95418>黄金杯!</color>,贏得一關即可獲得無限生命，並加入<color=#B95418>黃金杯!</color>,레벨을 클리어해 무제한 라이프를 획득하고 <color=#B95418>골든 컵!</color>에 참가하세요,Menangkan level untuk mendapatkan nyawa tak terbatas dan bergabung dengan <color=#B95418>Piala Emas!</color>,\"Gewinne ein Level, um unbegrenzte Leben zu erhalten und beim <color=#B95418>Goldpokal!</color> mitzumachen\",Gana un nivel para conseguir vidas ilimitadas y unirte a la <color=#B95418>Copa Dorada!</color>,Vinci un livello per ottenere vite illimitate e unirti alla <color=#B95418>Coppa d'Oro!</color>,Vença um nível para ganhar vidas ilimitadas e entrar na <color=#B95418>Copa Dourada!</color>,\"Выиграйте уровень, чтобы получить бесконечные жизни и присоединиться к <color=#B95418>Золотому кубку!</color>\"\ngolden_cup_info_5,,Beat levels without failing to increase the <color=#FEF341>Scrore Multiplier!</color>,Başarısız olmadan seviyeleri geçerek <color=#FEF341>Skor Çarpanını!</color> artır!,Terminez des niveaux sans échouer pour augmenter le <color=#FEF341>multiplicateur de score!</color>,失敗せずにレベルをクリアして<color=#FEF341>スコア倍率!</color>を上げよう!,不失败地通关关卡即可提升<color=#FEF341>得分倍率!</color>,不失敗通關關卡即可提升<color=#FEF341>得分倍率!</color>,실패하지 않고 레벨을 클리어해 <color=#FEF341>점수 배율!</color>을 올리세요!,Selesaikan level tanpa gagal untuk meningkatkan <color=#FEF341>Pengali Skor!</color>,\"Schließe Level ab, ohne zu scheitern, um den <color=#FEF341>Punktemultiplikator!</color> zu erhöhen!\",Supera niveles sin fallar para aumentar el <color=#FEF341>multiplicador de puntuación!</color>,Supera i livelli senza fallire per aumentare il <color=#FEF341>moltiplicatore di punteggio!</color>,Conclua fases sem falhar para aumentar o <color=#FEF341>Multiplicador de Pontuação!</color>,\"Проходите уровни без ошибок, чтобы увеличить <color=#FEF341>множитель очков!</color>\"\nbounce_streak_popup_start_info,,Complete all steps to win the Grand Prize!,Büyük Ödülü kazanmak için tüm adımları tamamla!,Terminez toutes les étapes pour gagner le Grand Prix!,すべてのステップを完了してグランドプライズを獲得しよう!,完成所有步骤赢取大奖!,完成所有步驟贏取大獎!,모든 단계를 완료하고 그랜드 프라이즈를 받으세요!,Selesaikan semua langkah untuk memenangkan Hadiah Utama!,\"Schließe alle Schritte ab, um den Hauptpreis zu gewinnen!\",Completa todos los pasos para ganar el Gran Premio!,Completa tutti i passaggi per vincere il Gran Premio!,Conclua todas as etapas para ganhar o Grande Prêmio!,\"Выполните все шаги, чтобы выиграть Главный приз!\"\nkitchen_collection,,Kitchen Collection,Mutfak Koleksiyonu,Collection Cuisine,キッチンコレクション,厨房合集,廚房合集,주방 컬렉션,Koleksi Dapur,Küchenkollektion,Colección de Cocina,Collezione Cucina,Coleção de Cozinha,Кухонная коллекция\ntop_the_leaderboard,,Top the leaderborad!,Liderlik tablosunun zirvesine çık!,Atteins le sommet du classement!,ランキングの頂点へ!,登顶排行榜!,登頂排行榜!,리더보드 1위를 차지하세요!,Puncaki papan peringkat!,An die Spitze der Rangliste!,¡Llega a lo más alto de la clasificación!,In cima alla classifica!,Chegue ao topo do ranking!,Поднимись на вершину таблицы лидеров!\ngolden_cup_info_tutorial,,Beat levels on your\\n<color=yellow>First Try</color> to get points!,Puan kazanmak için seviyeleri\\n<color=yellow>İlk Denemede</color> geç!,Réussis les niveaux\\n<color=yellow>du premier coup</color> pour gagner des points!,レベルを\\n<color=yellow>一発クリア</color>してポイントを獲得しよう!,关卡在你的\\n<color=yellow>首次尝试</color>中通关即可获得积分!,關卡在你的\\n<color=yellow>首次嘗試</color>中通關即可獲得積分!,포인트를 얻으려면 레벨을\\n<color=yellow>첫 시도</color>에 클리어하세요!,\"Untuk mendapatkan poin, selesaikan level\\n<color=yellow>pada Percobaan Pertama</color>!\",\"Schließe Level beim\\n<color=yellow>ersten Versuch</color> ab, um Punkte zu erhalten!\",Supera niveles a la\\n<color=yellow>primera</color> para conseguir puntos!,Supera i livelli al\\n<color=yellow>primo tentativo</color> per ottenere punti!,Conclua fases na\\n<color=yellow>primeira tentativa</color> para ganhar pontos!,\"Проходи уровни с\\n<color=yellow>первой попытки</color>, чтобы получать очки!\"\ncollection_card_stars,,Card Stars,Kart Yıldızları,Étoiles de cartes,カードスター,卡牌星星,卡牌星星,카드 스타,Bintang Kartu,Kartensterne,Estrellas de cartas,Stelle delle Carte,Estrelas de Cartas,Звезды карт\ncollection_open_chests,,Open Chests using copy card stars!,Kopya Kart Yıldızlarını kullanarak Sandıkları Aç!,Ouvre des coffres avec des Étoiles de cartes en double!,重複カードスターでチェストを開けよう!,使用重复卡牌星星开启宝箱!,使用重複卡牌星星開啟寶箱!,중복 카드 스타를 사용해 상자를 여세요!,Buka Peti menggunakan Bintang Kartu Duplikat!,Öffne Truhen mit doppelten Kartensternen!,Abre cofres usando Estrellas de cartas duplicadas!,Apri i forzieri usando le Stelle delle Carte duplicate!,Abra baús usando Estrelas de Cartas duplicadas!,\"Открывайте сундуки, используя дубликаты Звезд карт!\"\ncurrent_star,,Current Star,Mevcut Yıldız,Étoile actuelle,現在のスター,当前星星,目前星星,현재 스타,Bintang Saat Ini,Aktueller Stern,Estrella actual,Stella attuale,Estrela Atual,Текущая звезда\ncollection_earn_card,,\"Earn Card packs from\\nevents Hard, Super level \\n and tournaments!\",\"Etkinliklerden,\\nZor, Süper seviyelerden \\n ve turnuvalardan Kart paketleri kazan!\",\"Gagnez des packs de cartes dans\\nles événements, niveaux Difficile, Super \\n et les tournois!\",カードパックを獲得:\\nイベント、ハード、スーパー レベル \\n やトーナメントで！,从以下获得卡包:\\n活动、困难、超级关卡 \\n 和锦标赛！,從以下獲得卡包:\\n活動、困難、超級關卡 \\n 和錦標賽！,\"다음에서 카드 팩을 획득:\\n이벤트, 하드, 슈퍼 레벨 \\n 및 토너먼트!\",\"Dapatkan paket Kartu dari\\nEvent, level Sulit, Super \\n dan turnamen!\",\"Verdiene Kartenpakete durch\\nEvents, Schwierig- und Super-Level \\n sowie Turniere!\",\"Gana paquetes de Cartas en\\nEventos, niveles Difícil y Súper \\n y torneos!\",\"Ottieni pacchetti di Carte da\\neventi, livelli Difficile, Super \\n e tornei!\",\"Ganhe pacotes de Cartas em\\neventos, níveis Difícil, Super \\n e torneios!\",\"Получайте наборы карт в\\nсобытиях, на уровнях «Сложно» и «Супер» \\n а также на турнирах!\"\ncollection_complete_all,,Complete all sets to win\\nthe grand prize!,Büyük ödülü kazanmak için\\ntüm setleri tamamla!,Termine toutes les collections pour gagner\\nle grand prix!,すべてのセットを完成させて\\n大賞を手に入れよう!,完成所有套装以赢得\\n终极大奖!,完成所有套裝以贏得\\n終極大獎!,모든 세트를 완료하고\\n최고의 상을 받으세요!,Selesaikan semua set untuk memenangkan\\nhadiah utama!,\"Schließe alle Sets ab, um\\nden Hauptpreis zu gewinnen!\",Completa todos los sets para ganar\\nel gran premio!,Completa tutti i set per vincere\\nil premio principale!,Complete todos os conjuntos para ganhar\\no grande prêmio!,\"Соберите все наборы, чтобы выиграть\\nглавный приз!\"\ncollection_collect_the_cards,,Collect the cards and complete\\nthe sets in your collection,Kartları topla ve koleksiyonundaki\\nsetleri tamamla,Collecte les cartes et complète\\nles collections de ta collection,カードを集めて\\nコレクションのセットを完成させよう,收集卡牌并完成\\n你的收藏中的套装,收集卡牌並完成\\n你收藏中的套裝,카드를 모아\\n컬렉션의 세트를 완성하세요,Kumpulkan kartu dan selesaikan\\nset di koleksimu,Sammle die Karten und vervollständige\\ndie Sets in deiner Sammlung,Reúne las cartas y completa\\nlos sets de tu colección,Raccogli le carte e completa\\ni set nella tua collezione,Colete as cartas e complete\\nos conjuntos na sua coleção,Собирайте карты и завершайте\\nнаборы в вашей коллекции\nname,,Name,Ad,Nom,名前,名称,名稱,이름,Nama,Name,Nombre,Nome,Nome,Имя\n_level,,level,seviye,niveau,レベル,等级,等級,레벨,level,level,nivel,livello,nível,уровень\nspatula_badge,,Spatula Badge!,Spatula Rozeti!,Badge Spatule!,フライ返しバッジ!,锅铲徽章!,鍋鏟徽章!,뒤집개 배지!,Lencana Spatula!,Pfannenwender-Abzeichen!,Insignia de Espátula!,Distintivo Spatola!,Emblema de Espátula!,Значок «Лопатка»!\ncollection_complete_kitchen,,Complete Kitchen Collection to get this badge,Bu rozeti almak için Mutfak Koleksiyonunu tamamla,Termine la collection Cuisine pour obtenir ce badge,キッチンコレクションを完成させてこのバッジを獲得,完成厨房收藏即可获得此徽章,完成廚房收藏即可獲得此徽章,주방 컬렉션을 완료하면 이 배지를 얻을 수 있습니다,Selesaikan Koleksi Dapur untuk mendapatkan lencana ini,\"Vervollständige die Küchen-Sammlung, um dieses Abzeichen zu erhalten\",Completa la Colección de Cocina para obtener esta insignia,Completa la Collezione Cucina per ottenere questo distintivo,Complete a Coleção da Cozinha para obter este emblema,\"Завершите коллекцию «Кухня», чтобы получить этот значок\"\nbagel,,Bagel,Bagel,Bagel,ベーグル,贝果,貝果,베이글,Bagel,Bagel,Bagel,Bagel,Bagel,Бейгл\ncereal,,Cereal,Kahvaltılık Gevrek,Céréales,シリアル,麦片,麥片,시리얼,Sereal,Müsli,Cereales,Cereali,Cereal,Хлопья\negg,,Egg,Yumurta,Œuf,卵,鸡蛋,雞蛋,달걀,Telur,Ei,Huevo,Uovo,Ovo,Яйцо\njam,,Jam,Reçel,Confiture,ジャム,果酱,果醬,잼,Selai,Marmelade,Mermelada,Marmellata,Geleia,Джем\nolive,,Olive,Zeytin,Olive,オリーブ,橄榄,橄欖,올리브,Zaitun,Olive,Aceituna,Oliva,Azeitona,Оливка\nomelette,,Omelette,Omlet,Omelette,オムレツ,煎蛋卷,煎蛋捲,오믈렛,Omelet,Omelett,Tortilla francesa,Omelette,Omelete,Омлет\norangejuice,,Orange Juice,Portakal Suyu,Jus d'orange,オレンジジュース,橙汁,橙汁,오렌지 주스,Jus Jeruk,Orangensaft,Jugo de naranja,Succo d'arancia,Suco de laranja,Апельсиновый сок\ntea,,Tea,Çay,Thé,ティー,茶,茶,차,Teh,Tee,Té,Tè,Chá,Чай\ntoast,,Toast,Tost,Toast,トースト,吐司,吐司,토스트,Roti Panggang,Toast,Tostada,Toast,Torrada,Тост\nbreakfast,,Breakfast,Kahvaltı,Petit-déjeuner,朝食,早餐,早餐,아침 식사,Sarapan,Frühstück,Desayuno,Colazione,Café da manhã,Завтрак\n_completed,,Completed,Tamamlandı,Terminé,完了,已完成,已完成,완료,Selesai,Abgeschlossen,Completado,Completato,Concluído,Завершено\nchristmas,,Christmas,Noel,Noël,クリスマス,圣诞节,聖誕節,크리스마스,Natal,Weihnachten,Navidad,Natale,Natal,Рождество\ncandycane,,Candy Cane,Şeker Bastonu,Sucre d'orge,キャンディケイン,拐杖糖,拐杖糖,캔디 케인,Permen Tongkat,Zuckerstange,Bastón de caramelo,Bastoncino di zucche