ace başladı!\\nMuhteşem ödüller kazanmak için diğerlerinden önce <color=red>{0} Seviye</color> tamamla!,Sky Race a commencé!\\nTermine <color=red>{0} niveaux</color> avant les autres pour gagner des récompenses incroyables!,Sky Raceが始まった！\\n他の人より先に<color=red>{0} レベル</color>クリアして、豪華報酬を獲得しよう！,天空竞速已开始！\\n在其他人之前通关<color=red>{0} 关卡</color>，赢取惊喜奖励！,天空競速已開始！\\n在其他人之前通關<color=red>{0} 關卡</color>，贏取驚喜獎勵！,Sky Race가 시작됐어요!\\n다른 사람들보다 먼저 <color=red>{0} 레벨</color>을 클리어해 멋진 보상을 받으세요!,Sky Race telah dimulai!\\nKalahkan <color=red>{0} Level</color> sebelum yang lain untuk memenangkan hadiah menakjubkan!,\"Sky Race hat begonnen!\\nSchließe vor allen anderen <color=red>{0} Level</color> ab, um tolle Belohnungen zu gewinnen!\",Sky Race ha comenzado!\\nSupera <color=red>{0} niveles</color> antes que los demás para ganar recompensas increíbles!,Sky Race è iniziata!\\nSupera <color=red>{0} livelli</color> prima degli altri per vincere fantastici premi!,A Sky Race começou!\\nConclua <color=red>{0} níveis</color> antes dos outros para ganhar recompensas incríveis!,\"Sky Race началась!\\nПройди <color=red>{0} уровней</color> раньше других, чтобы выиграть потрясающие награды!\"\nsky_race_tutorial_info,,Get 15 wins before the other players,Diğer oyunculardan önce 15 galibiyet al,Obtiens 15 victoires avant les autres joueurs,他のプレイヤーより先に15勝しよう,在其他玩家之前获得15场胜利,在其他玩家之前獲得15場勝利,다른 플레이어보다 먼저 15승을 달성하세요,Raih 15 kemenangan sebelum pemain lain,Hol dir 15 Siege vor den anderen Spielern,Consigue 15 victorias antes que los demás jugadores,Ottieni 15 vittorie prima degli altri giocatori,Consiga 15 vitórias antes dos outros jogadores,Одержи 15 побед раньше других игроков\nwin_awesome_rewards,,Win awesome Rewads!,Harika ödüller kazan!,Gagne des récompenses géniales !,すごい報酬をゲット！,赢取超棒奖励！,贏取超棒獎勵！,멋진 보상을 획득하세요!,Menangkan hadiah keren!,Gewinne fantastische Belohnungen!,¡Gana recompensas geniales!,Vinci ricompense fantastiche!,Ganhe recompensas sensacionais!,Выиграй потрясающие награды!\nsky_race_text_info,,Congratulations! You Finished {0} and won a reward!,Tebrikler! {0} tamamladın ve bir ödül kazandın!,Félicitations! Vous avez terminé {0} et gagné une récompense!,おめでとうございます！{0}をクリアして報酬を獲得しました！,恭喜！你完成了 {0} 并赢得了奖励！,恭喜！你完成了 {0} 並贏得了獎勵！,축하합니다! {0}을(를) 완료하고 보상을 획득했어요!,Selamat! Kamu menyelesaikan {0} dan memenangkan hadiah!,Glückwunsch! Du hast {0} abgeschlossen und eine Belohnung gewonnen!,¡Felicidades! Has completado {0} y has ganado una recompensa!,Congratulazioni! Hai completato {0} e hai vinto una ricompensa!,Parabéns! Você concluiu {0} e ganhou uma recompensa!,Поздравляем! Вы завершили {0} и получили награду!\nfail_challenge,,You failed the challenge,Bu meydan okumayı başaramadın,Tu as échoué au défi,チャレンジに失敗しました,挑战失败,挑戰失敗,도전에 실패했습니다,Kamu gagal dalam tantangan,Du hast die Herausforderung nicht geschafft,Has fallado el desafío,Hai fallito la sfida,Você falhou no desafio,Вы провалили испытание\ncollect_rewards,,Collect Rewards,Ödülleri Topla,Récupérer les récompenses,報酬を受け取る,领取奖励,領取獎勵,보상 받기,Kumpulkan Hadiah,Belohnungen abholen,Recoger recompensas,Raccogli ricompense,Coletar recompensas,Забрать награды\nunlock_levels,,Unlocks at level {0},Seviye {0}'de açılır,Débloqué au niveau {0},レベル{0}で解放,在{0}级解锁,於{0}級解鎖,레벨 {0}에서 잠금 해제,Terbuka di level {0},Freigeschaltet ab Level {0},Se desbloquea en el nivel {0},Si sblocca al livello {0},Desbloqueia no nível {0},Открывается на уровне {0}\nnf_title_megajellycover,,Mega Jelly Cover,Mega Jöle Örtüsü,Couverture de Méga Gelée,メガゼリーカバー,超级果冻罩,超級果凍罩,메가 젤리 커버,Penutup Jeli Mega,Mega-Gelee-Abdeckung,Cobertura de Mega Gelatina,Copertura Mega Gelatina,Cobertura de Mega Gelatina,Мега-покрытие желе\nnf_description_megajellycover,,Hides a certain amount of jellies beneath itself. Opens once the required number of jellies of a specified color are sent to the shredder.,Altında belirli sayıda jelibon saklar. Belirtilen renkte gerekli sayıda jelibon parçalayıcıya gönderilince açılır.,Cache un certain nombre de gelées sous lui. S’ouvre lorsque le nombre requis de gelées d’une couleur donnée est envoyé dans le broyeur.,下に一定数のゼリーを隠している。指定された色のゼリーを必要数シュレッダーに送ると開く。,在其下方隐藏一定数量的果冻。将指定颜色的果冻按要求数量送入粉碎机后会打开。,在其下方隱藏一定數量的果凍。將指定顏色的果凍依要求數量送入粉碎機後會打開。,아래에 일정 수의 젤리를 숨깁니다. 지정된 색상의 젤리를 필요한 개수만큼 분쇄기에 보내면 열립니다.,Menyembunyikan sejumlah jelly di bawahnya. Terbuka setelah jumlah jelly yang dibutuhkan dengan warna tertentu dikirim ke penghancur.,\"Versteckt eine bestimmte Anzahl an Gelees darunter. Öffnet sich, sobald die erforderliche Anzahl Gelees einer bestimmten Farbe zum Schredder geschickt wurde.\",Oculta cierta cantidad de gelatinas debajo. Se abre cuando se envía a la trituradora la cantidad necesaria de gelatinas de un color específico.,Nasconde una certa quantità di gelatine sotto di sé. Si apre quando il numero richiesto di gelatine di un colore specifico viene inviato al trituratore.,Esconde uma certa quantidade de gelatinas embaixo. Abre quando o número necessário de gelatinas de uma cor específica é enviado ao triturador.,\"Скрывает под собой определённое количество желе. Открывается, когда в шредер отправлено нужное количество желе указанного цвета.\"\nnew_booster_booster_is_supporting_player,,NEW BOOSTER,YENİ GÜÇLENDİRİCİ,NOUVEAU BOOSTER,新しいブースター,全新助推器,全新助推器,새 부스터,BOOSTER BARU,NEUER BOOSTER,NUEVO POTENCIADOR,NUOVO POTENZIATORE,NOVO IMPULSIONADOR,НОВЫЙ УСИЛИТЕЛЬ\nballon_streak,,Balloon Streak,Balon Serisi,Série de ballons,バルーンストリーク,气球连胜,氣球連勝,풍선 연승,Rangkaian Balon,Ballon-Serie,Racha de globos,Serie di palloncini,Sequência de Balões,Серия воздушных шаров\nPass_the_levels,,Pass the levels without failing!,Seviyeleri başarısız olmadan geç!,Passe les niveaux sans échouer!,失敗せずにレベルをクリアしよう！,不失败地通关！,不失敗地通關！,실패하지 말고 레벨을 클리어하세요!,Lewati level tanpa gagal!,\"Schließe die Level ab, ohne zu scheitern!\",¡Pasa los niveles sin fallar!,Supera i livelli senza fallire!,Passe os níveis sem falhar!,Проходи уровни без ошибок!\nrise,,Rise!,Yüksel!,Monte!,上がれ！,上升！,上升！,상승!,Naik!,Aufsteigen!,¡Sube!,Sali!,Suba!,Поднимайся!\nballon_streak_popup,,Balloon Streak Started! May each <color=red>Winning Streak</color> bring you great rewards!,Balon Serisi Başladı! Her <color=red>Kazanma Serisi</color> sana harika ödüller getirsin!,Série de ballons lancée! Que chaque <color=red>série de victoires</color> t'apporte de super récompenses!,バルーンストリーク開始！<color=red>連勝</color>のたびに豪華報酬がもらえますように！,气球连胜开始！愿每次<color=red>连胜</color>都为你带来丰厚奖励！,氣球連勝開始！願每次<color=red>連勝</color>都為你帶來豐厚獎勵！,풍선 연승 시작! 매 <color=red>연승</color>마다 멋진 보상이 함께하길!,Rangkaian Balon Dimulai! Semoga setiap <color=red>Rangkaian Kemenangan</color> memberimu hadiah besar!,Ballon-Serie gestartet! Möge dir jede <color=red>Siegesserie</color> tolle Belohnungen bringen!,¡Racha de globos iniciada! Que cada <color=red>racha ganadora</color> te traiga grandes recompensas!,Serie di palloncini iniziata! Che ogni <color=red>serie vincente</color> ti porti grandi ricompense!,Sequência de Balões Iniciada! Que cada <color=red>sequência de vitórias</color> traga grandes recompensas!,Серия воздушных шаров началась! Пусть каждая <color=red>серия побед</color> приносит тебе отличные награды!\nlava_rush_app_event,\"Lava Rush kelimesi özel isim değil. Tamamı çevirilmeli. Ayrıca, Rush'ın karşılığı yarış olacak her dilde. Örnek olarak türkçedeki karşılığı Lav Yarışı olacak.\",You need to reach Level {0} for the Lava Rush! Only {1} levels to go!,Lav Yarışı için Seviye {0}'e ulaşman gerekiyor! Kalan sadece {1} seviye!,Vous devez atteindre le niveau {0} pour la Course de lave! Plus que {1} niveaux!,溶岩レースに参加するにはレベル{0}に到達する必要があります! あと{1}レベル!,参加熔岩竞速赛需要达到{0}级! 还差{1}级!,參加熔岩競速賽需要達到{0}級! 還差{1}級!,용암 레이스에 참여하려면 레벨 {0}에 도달해야 합니다! 이제 {1}레벨만 남았어요!,Kamu harus mencapai Level {0} untuk Balapan Lava! Tinggal {1} level lagi!,\"Du musst Level {0} erreichen, um am Lava-Rennen teilzunehmen! Nur noch {1} Level!\",Necesitas alcanzar el nivel {0} para la Carrera de Lava! Solo faltan {1} niveles!,Devi raggiungere il livello {0} per la Gara di Lava! Mancano solo {1} livelli!,Você precisa alcançar o nível {0} para a Corrida de Lava! Faltam apenas {1} níveis!,\"Чтобы участвовать в Лавовой гонке, нужно достичь уровня {0}! Осталось всего {1} уровней!\"\nballoon_Streak_fail_panel,,Score Multiplier of the\\n<color=red>Balloon Stereak</color> will be reset?,Puan Çarpanı\\n<color=red>Balloon Stereak</color> sıfırlansın mı?,Le multiplicateur de score du\\n<color=red>Balloon Stereak</color> sera réinitialisé?,スコア倍率がリセットされます:\\n<color=red>Balloon Stereak</color>?,以下的得分倍数将被重置:\\n<color=red>Balloon Stereak</color>?,以下的得分倍數將被重置:\\n<color=red>Balloon Stereak</color>?,다음 점수 배수가 초기화됩니다:\\n<color=red>Balloon Stereak</color>?,Pengganda Skor dari\\n<color=red>Balloon Stereak</color> akan direset?,Punkte-Multiplikator des\\n<color=red>Balloon Stereak</color> wird zurückgesetzt?,¿Se reiniciará el multiplicador de puntuación de\\n<color=red>Balloon Stereak</color>?,Il moltiplicatore di punteggio di\\n<color=red>Balloon Stereak</color> verrà reimpostato?,O multiplicador de pontuação de\\n<color=red>Balloon Stereak</color> será redefinido?,Множитель очков для\\n<color=red>Balloon Stereak</color> будет сброшен?\npackages,,Packages,Paketler,Packs,パッケージ,礼包,禮包,패키지,Paket,Pakete,Paquetes,Pacchetti,Pacotes,Наборы\ncollection_system_package_info,,Get a {0},Bir {0},Obtenez {0},{0}を獲得,获得{0},獲得{0},{0} 획득,Dapatkan {0},Erhalte {0},Consigue {0},Ottieni {0},Obtenha {0},Получите {0}\nbounce_card,\"Bounce Card kelimesi özel isim değil. Tamamı çevirilmeli. Ayrıca, Bounce nin! ın karşılığı Bounce olacak her dilde. Örnek olarak türkçedeki karşılığı Bounce Kart olacak.\",Bounce Card,Bounce Kart,Carte Bounce,Bounceカード,Bounce卡牌,Bounce卡牌,Bounce 카드,Bounce Kartu,Bounce-Karte,Carta Bounce,Carta Bounce,Carta Bounce,Карта Bounce\nminutes,,{0} Minutes,{0} Dakika,{0} Minutes,{0}分,{0}分钟,{0}分鐘,{0}분,{0} Menit,{0} Minuten,{0} Minutos,{0} Minuti,{0} Minutos,{0} Минут\nearn_coin,,{0} Earn Coins,{0} Jeton Kazan,{0} Gagnez des Pièces,{0} コインを獲得,{0} 获得金币,{0} 獲得金幣,{0} 코인 획득,{0} Dapatkan Koin,{0} Verdiene Münzen,{0} Gana Monedas,{0} Guadagna Monete,{0} Ga